WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:03.041
- This is why ultimately

00:00:03.041 --> 00:00:05.791
self-esteem is the one thing
I want to impose on my children

00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:07.375
more than anything in the world.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.625
Because when you
actually have self esteem

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:13.458
then peer pressure
is an afterthought.

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.000
You're just blocking
that shit with

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.958
your self-esteem 24/7/365.

